Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Tower of the Dark\NTower Alciniun is the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tower of the Dark Tower\Nfrom the Black War Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the night after\Nwe fell as a black glove
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(319,329)}Storm of Love - Silphymon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be able to track Black War\NGreymon by following the spatial disruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't delude you, my sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had better be right, Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and don't call me that\Ni am your eternal slave
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my dear whatever you wish\Nyou're pathetic speed up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm growing weary of you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we needed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hole in the head i think\Nthat's exactly black war
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,graymon's plan if he even\Nlooks at carrie the wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way i'll put a hole in his\Nhead i don't care if he
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a mega very courageous\Nbut crazy even if you could
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digivolve to ultimate which\Nlet Let me remind you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the rest of you could DNA\NDigivolve, he'd be toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you could have more\Nof an attitude, little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How rude, but he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could work this, but who with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, who's my partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're also young and inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'll learn quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Black War Greymon\Ndissed our Kunemon like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she was as surprised as we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War Greymon's a loose cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think he's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of feel sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be very confused and lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She created him to be a fighting machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just seems really sad to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds to me like you're worrying\Nabout a cold-blooded monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just care about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the difference\Nbetween you and Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She cares about other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what it sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have to separate you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's stupid to fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go to the digital world and\Nfinish what we started yeah if we
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knock down the control spires old\Nwhite hair is out of business car
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're with me aren't you yeah i'm\Nwith you davis yeah i hate to admit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it but davis may be right about carrie\Nand me she never puts her foot in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her mouth like i do i never know\Nwhat she's thinking it kind of makes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:05:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me nervous. So anyway, then the guy\Nsays, "Knock knock, V-Mon. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no more knock-knock jokes this\Nisn't a knock-knock joke it's a joke
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.32,0:05:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about a guy who tells knock-knock jokes\Nno more you're no fun this is weird
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is it Gatomon this is it i thought it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looked familiar it's\Nwhere i lost my tail ring
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really are you sure\Npositively it was awful ken
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasn't so sweet back then\Nand even good Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like Unimon, were forced\Nto do his dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't look for my ring back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if I had it now, I'd\Nbe one tough Digi-Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to go\Nfind it, whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to win points with Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it actually worked this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even Davis can strike out every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's\Nwhat you meant to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, you're with me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be confused, but\Nhe happens to be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one point for Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two points and a cookie if you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that clearing we\Npassed is the best bet, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we start there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to usual, huh, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the difference\Nbetween you and Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She cares about other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.62,0:06:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harold, this is exceedingly tedious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're the one with\Nthe bird's eye view.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Ken, he's in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:07:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate it when she does that. Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear him scream just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Ken, something's wrong with him Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ken, we're here\Nnow, it'll be okay What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything\NThe ocean He's finally
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cracked. It was the dark\Nocean. It's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dark ocean could it be maybe it's\Ncontagious I can't see a thing how about you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon it's nothing I'm fine no you're\Nnot you're clearly seeing things the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ocean huh I think I know how you're feeling\Nmaybe we should just play along Hawkmon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think he fell in his head I did\Nthat once and thought I was a fruit bat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is hopeless. We can't\Njust give up. No way, Kari's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,counting on me to find this thing\Nfor Where'd she and Yoli go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are three of them,\Nbut who's there with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:07:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These trees are all\Nbeginning to look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tall and really, really dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we've been chasing\Nour tail this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we're going in circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we're lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forever and ever till we die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Davis! We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here! Vemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis! T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Vemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I feel faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we sure I heard a voice over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe they're ghost Vemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, we're right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?\NCorey! Corey! Yoli! Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can see him, why can't he see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, TJ, did you find Corey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem to have just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't have gone that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I couldn't find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go up with Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to try harder. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready, Armadimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the way this\Nfog keeps getting thicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you don't like that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we play a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can play my favorite game, Telebone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot there are only three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that would be pretty boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how are we going to\Nfind our way home if we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't even know where we are it's hopeless
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing is ever hopeless ken you of all\Npeople should know that there are too many
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people who want us back and we want to\Ngo back too much to be stuck here forever
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:10:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why won't you talk to me what do you two\Nwant to be alone or something you could
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just say so instead of ignoring me like\Nthis we're not ignoring you yes you are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, um, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I did it again, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hawkmon, whatever was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking is precisely what\Nyou didn't do Ken probably
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hates me after I made a fool of\Nmyself. I doubt that. Uh-oh, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, got him on, I think we\Nfound it My tail ring? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See right down there. What\Ndo you think, Gatomon? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't tell from here i\Nknow i've seen this before
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but where there are too\Nmany gaps in my memory
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why can i only remember\Nthe awful things and not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the things that would\Nhelp someone it almost
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feels like it's on purpose\Nhe has that look again
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's only one way to\Nfind out oh yoli i beg of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't you worry too much\Nof course She's worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the least they can do after...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you wouldn't do this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at this exact moment, so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.02,0:11:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curry! Shen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Lee, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:12:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried. About me? Why? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember seeing something shining\Ndown here, but then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The usual, you did something absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we did find this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a dark ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying so hard not\Nto be selfish for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought it was the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just saying that. No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was very thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pagumon Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I just can't\Ndo it. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for jokes, Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around and digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you pick on me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just fell from a cliff, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here she goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't digivolve, we'll\Nnever get out of this canyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even if we do, where will we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.61,0:12:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we be fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis ran right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we won't. My life is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never get married, have children\Nmake millions in the stock market.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:12:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brutal, but effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if we can\Nfind a way out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, I'm really sorry for\Nslapping you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to bring out the worst in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe because we're so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be honest, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is I envy you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could say what\NI'm feeling like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep everything inside\Nso no one gets hurt but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why I was drawn into\Nthe world of darkness, just like Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not like Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We keep too much inside,\Nmaking us vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rescue is at hand. Going up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um... Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:13:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you were afraid, and it would have\Nbeen silly for you to fall down with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so freaked out, you probably\Nwouldn't have done any good anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were brave back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Elise, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't really\Nwant to be reminded of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guess what we found down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll think this is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Gatomon's tail ring at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was one of your dark rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's not funny, but\NI didn't mean funny ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant funny ironic funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you made\Nthem, I'm not blaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just making it worse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, what's wrong? The waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear the waves. Kari? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this darkness inside of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside of Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:14:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why we can't get away from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I were stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cora knew what it wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is the dark ocean. Ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I see are a bunch of trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is indeed an ocean of trees, but\NI don't think that's what they mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost lost Kari once\Nbefore to this stupid ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew what it was with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.74,0:15:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, you've been here, seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know anyone but\Nme had ever been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari sees it, and now Ken, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why\NI can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Lee, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something doesn't feel right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if the world has\Nslipped out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's because\Nthe powers guarding
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the digital world are losing their grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about\Nsomething that Izzy told us once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What powers was he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this delightful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:16:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those whorlish little children\Nhave stumbled into a phase war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have no idea how vulnerable they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame we have to keep\Nfollowing Black War, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little operation is unworthy\Nof my personal attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirit Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your lunch, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to fight it, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.11,0:16:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be home soon, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Big Brother is watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or at least his corsage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Blossomon, an ultimate Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her spiral flower attack\Nis a good excuse for
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weed killer and her children\Nare worse than thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Behind her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a rolling space!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see right through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that's my cue. About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll have no trouble digivolving\Nnow. Are you ready? Let me add her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon! Wormmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't think I\Ncan stand it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiking Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:17:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kara, you have to talk\Nto me or I can't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness won't leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never be strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of that nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you're strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the strongest\Nperson I've ever known!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you think I'm going to sit by\Nand let you run on yourself like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can just think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fight it together, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.78,0:18:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness will never\Nbeat you, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a true friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot, yours is the crest of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the power to\Nlight up the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the worst enemy of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.22,0:19:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silphymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silphymon is the DNA Digivolts\Nform of Gatomon and Aquilamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silphimon's static force is the ultimate\Nweapon against darkness and hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has Gatomon's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Aquilemon's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That overgrown Daisy's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's send this Control Spy or Digimon\Nback to the spider in a dust pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the way you think, Gatomon! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.72,0:20:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet it's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It started without us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, she's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, she's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.68,0:20:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember my now, Julie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Selfie, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rats, I guess that means you only\Nas Kari's DNA Digivolve partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, T .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.55,0:20:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot more to\NKen than a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kari, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fight enemies I never even see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't fight them alone\Nanymore, not if I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.14,0:20:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd really lost you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid you'd slipped\Ninto the other world for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I won't be\Nfighting it alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyo Lee won't let me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's reimagine what
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to say?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.20,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:22:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single time, you filter out
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.70,0:22:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You run away. Every single\Ntime, you're anywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.14,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all at the same time.\NYou're not alone, you're not alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.14,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.84,0:22:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital World in a huge impact\Non the secret of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the student will protect the Ironcani-Mami
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.34,0:22:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mon of the hand of the\Nsecret of this secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:23:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Digimon Adventure 02 The secret\Nof the Holy Stone Now, the gate is open.
